  "props[].model_prob = rate-model probability (binomial/DP/Poisson over expected PA) passed through an isotonic calibration map fitted on graded history with as-of-date stats. NOT a rescaled edge_score. Rows flagged FLAT_MAP carry the calibrated base rate only. See prop_calibration for per-type sample sizes and pred-vs-actual.",
